  "description": "Welcome to Dice Goblins Clicker, an idle clicker game about goblins, dice, and extremely irresponsible use of probability.\n\nClick to roll dice. Dice make numbers. Big numbers make goblins happy.\n\nHire more goblins, unlock better dice, and stack absurd upgrades that turn “a little luck” into a full blown statistical crime. As your goblin horde grows, rolls become faster, multipliers get sillier, and the dice keep rolling even when you’re not looking.\n\nDiscover chaotic modifiers, strange synergies, and questionable goblin inventions that bend luck, logic, and common sense. Optimize your setup or just stare at the numbers going up, goblins don’t judge.\n\nWhether you play for five minutes or leave it running all day, it's about one thing only Roll dice, get bigger numbers, summon more goblins, break stuff and repeat!\n\n\nFeatures\n6 different dice types\n3 unique goblin types\n25 achievements for true perfectionists\nPrestige system for endless progression\nUp to 12 upgrade modifiers",
